    gotchas: ['Credit the security deposit in the claim itself. Asking for amounts already covered by the deposit undermines the whole claim.', 'Most states impose a duty to mitigate: rent after move-out is recoverable only for a reasonable re-letting period despite real efforts to re-let.', 'Normal wear and tear is not recoverable in any state. Photograph and invoice every claimed item, or expect it to be cut.'],
